2026-07-27T09:18:13.8177396Z i /tmp/RtmpqPhkRG/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:18:13.8177880Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:18:13.8178412Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:18:13.8178870Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:18:13.8179641Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:18:13.8180704Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:18:13.8182037Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
